    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 292,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the community consultation about the library garden. I'm Maya, the project coordinator. We have three plans. Plan A is a quiet reading garden. Plan B is a children's play area. Plan C is a small vegetable garden. Please listen, then we vote.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f3c4d483cacb1f04ba5f360a5975c66422da967b27c3df06d79daac4e03be1eb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "mr chen",
        "speaker": "Mr. Chen",
        "sourceStart": 304,
        "sourceEnd": 460,
        "text": "Excuse me, Maya. I'm Chen Wei. I live next to the library. I support Plan A because I need a quiet place to read. But I'm worried about noise from children.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6cb7946131c63243952c371718fa36223cd4363bf456ba9d3515fa1235b909e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 468,
        "sourceEnd": 509,
        "text": "Thank you, Mr. Chen. That's a fair point.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "549ea600c4a13af414e2947d7eb1258b66c30b72e059f09ef84f02287c544a5e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ms li",
        "speaker": "Ms. Li",
        "sourceStart": 519,
        "sourceEnd": 679,
        "text": "Hello, I'm Li Fang. I'm a mother of two. I prefer Plan B because my children have no safe place to play. Although the library is quiet, children need space too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "96f404b6fb9193ba9bf6d00c7c571292a79e7dc54575e8075aa1a6ebb7cb7c13",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mr chen",
        "speaker": "Mr. Chen",
        "sourceStart": 691,
        "sourceEnd": 814,
        "text": "I understand, Ms. Li. But the garden is small. While I agree children need space, the noise could be a problem for readers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d1bcd38289cd1921b84a017ae80d6ca7b655847130cda02c17d9aea60923c4c2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ms li",
        "speaker": "Ms. Li",
        "sourceStart": 824,
        "sourceEnd": 910,
        "text": "Maybe we can have quiet hours. Because of the small size, we can use times, not walls.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cf0095c3e2264ff5bf1c12a24dff196cdef68344d1333665d09b9dca44150e32",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 954,
        "text": "Good idea. Let's hear from Mr. Park.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "01fea9b35b320e63fab222a81604fd0d1bd91d56751c9f86144f49c8659312a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mr park",
        "speaker": "Mr. Park",
        "sourceStart": 966,
        "sourceEnd": 1124,
        "text": "Hi, I'm Joon Park. I run the local food bank. I like Plan C because fresh vegetables help families. However, I know vegetables need care. Who will water them?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "dd60daa979322089903f86b3394f52bce6c1552004e01e16996cbff83df26b0a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1132,
        "sourceEnd": 1196,
        "text": "The library volunteers can help. They already work on Saturdays.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "28c2f0957c6fd47efbf83c09bf95a0c80eee106325743a5ac97dc71ae6251c1a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mr park",
        "speaker": "Mr. Park",
        "sourceStart": 1208,
        "sourceEnd": 1335,
        "text": "That's good. But wait—I mean, I also worry about cost. Sorry, let me correct that. I worry about cost and time, not just water.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "42138e76bf411dd3f7663c24e1019ab344c9d5cc86eebed32358ce48ecf7bd3d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ms li",
        "speaker": "Ms. Li",
        "sourceStart": 1345,
        "sourceEnd": 1430,
        "text": "I can organize a parent group for watering. Because we live close, we can take turns.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "341ebf74b595597cd6ad852656404ad63314f66578c8c8629ea7922b5ccb8735",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mr chen",
        "speaker": "Mr. Chen",
        "sourceStart": 1442,
        "sourceEnd": 1579,
        "text": "While I still prefer Plan A, I could accept Plan C if the vegetable garden is in the back corner. Then readers can be quiet in the front.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc5d2c3bd2aaad54b40fe059f9c595c26f25af603c0b9b04255a597ae8890104",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1587,
        "sourceEnd": 1691,
        "text": "So, a mixed plan? Quiet reading in front, vegetables in the back, and children's play on Saturdays only?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cb7cd1622a1ac0e994976da3c1729fe4a957bdd1400fb2c8abddb2cedc2c5c5d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mr park",
        "speaker": "Mr. Park",
        "sourceStart": 1703,
        "sourceEnd": 1765,
        "text": "That sounds practical. Although it is not perfect, it is fair.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6331c1d9cdc8a1c4e0adca051dd3c2d628486a7f7c1cd3052ba23b4c1e5c7cd6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ms li",
        "speaker": "Ms. Li",
        "sourceStart": 1775,
        "sourceEnd": 1865,
        "text": "I agree. Because of the schedule, children have a safe time, and readers have quiet times.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7ee1d4d81ec0fe36bf427b82b62455fce9540d301bc226d842d24a216ec1c87f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1873,
        "sourceEnd": 2045,
        "text": "Great. Let's vote on the mixed plan. Please raise your hand. ... Thank you. The mixed plan passes with twelve votes. The next meeting is on June 15 at 6 p.m. Thank you all.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "35ce9ea9043a781fbb91dd6fcf8d67329a42a83d84aabdd2f0776e6b756d91ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
